Changes: React/PWA interface; Next.js server adapter; authenticated encrypted
cookies; explicit authentication/ownership checks; no identity-only login;
no password persistence; revised schedule/error interpretation; read-only
reconciliation after a lost attendance response; browser-aware QR expiration.

No Android widget or Breezy Weather implementation is included in MengSign.
